          "id": 2371581083,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/pipelines/1692230293  \nYou would think so but the lua subsystem has other ideas.  \n[`free_deregistered_field()`](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/proto.c#L9054) gets called when lua plugins are reloaded in the gui or as part of cleanup when run as script (as in pipeline test case). Hence the second version of the commit to make it a `strdup`.  \n  \n```\n\nglib-2.0-0.dll!g_free(void * mem) Line 240 (c:\\vcpkg\\buildtrees\\glib\\src\\glib-2-322e03f702.clean\\glib\\gmem.c:240)\n\nlibwireshark.dll!free_deregistered_field(void * data, void * user_data) Line 9063 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\proto.c:9063)\nglib-2.0-0.dll!g_ptr_array_foreach(_GPtrArray * array, void(*)(void *, void *) func, void * user_data) Line 2690 (c:\\vcpkg\\buildtrees\\glib\\src\\glib-2-322e03f702.clean\\glib\\garray.c:2690)\nlibwireshark.dll!proto_free_deregistered_fields() Line 9093 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\proto.c:9093)\nlibwireshark.dll!deregister_user_data() Line 895 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\dissectors\\packet-signal-pdu.c:895)\nlibwireshark.dll!reset_spdu_signal_list_and_value_names() Line 1235 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\dissectors\\packet-signal-pdu.c:1235)\nlibwireshark.dll!uat_clear(epan_uat * uat) Line 543 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\uat.c:543)\nlibwireshark.dll!uat_unload_all() Line 553 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\uat.c:553)\nlibwireshark.dll!prefs_reset() Line 4608 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\epan\\prefs.c:4608)\nWireshark.exe!MainApplication::readConfigurationFiles(bool reset) Line 1140 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\ui\\qt\\main_application.cpp:1140)\n\nWireshark.exe!WiresharkMainWindow::reloadLuaPlugins() Line 1628 (c:\\Development\\wireshark\\ui\\qt\\wireshark_main_window_slots.cpp:1628)\nWireshark.exe!QtPrivate::FunctorCall<QtPrivate::IndexesList<>,QtPrivate::List<>,void,void (__cdecl WiresharkMainWindow::*)(void)>::call(void(WiresharkMainWindow::*)() f, WiresharkMainWindow * o, void * * arg) Line 137 (c:\\Users\\admin1\\Desktop\\Qt6_installer\\6.5.3\\msvc2019_64\\include\\QtCore\\qobjectdefs_impl.h:137)\n```",
