        {
          "id": 2372885647,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Yes, but there currently is no way to do that.\n\n`expert_field_info` has two `const char *` fields - `name` and `summary`. `header_field_info` has three - `name`, `abbrev`, and `blurb`.\n\nsummary maps to name, name maps to abbrev, nothing maps to blurb. If another field were added to `expert_field_info` (that allowed dynamically allocated strings) then all the functions that construct it would be changed anyway.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
